{"html":"\n\t\t\n<p><span>A non-surgical eyelid lift offers a way to rejuvenate the eyes without undergoing surgery. At AestheticEye in Dayton, OH, our board-certified oculoplastic surgeons, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, provide advanced <a href=\"#/non-surgical-treatments/\">non-surgical treatments</a> to lift and refresh the eyelids. Using neurotoxins and other minimally invasive techniques, we help you achieve a youthful and vibrant look with minimal downtime.</span></p>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-1\">Understanding Aging Eyes</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>The delicate skin around the eyes often shows the first signs of aging, which can lead to a tired or aged appearance. Several factors contribute to this process:</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <blockquote>\n            <div>Dr. Ginger Henson was a perfect choice for me! She did an excellent job. I had no pain and healed up better than ever! I’m so happy with the job she did for me!</div>\n                            <footer>Lynne S.</footer>\n                        \n        </blockquote>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Causes of Aging Eyes</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Loss of Skin Elasticity</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Reduced collagen and elastin production lead to less firm and elastic skin.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Volume Loss</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Diminished fat pads in the eyelids create a hollow or sunken look.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Muscle Weakness</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Weaker muscles around the eyes cause sagging and drooping.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Environmental Factors</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Sun exposure, smoking, and pollution can accelerate aging.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_9808da5270d76d06e119594fe9e67a5e-column-4\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Genetics</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Genetic factors influence when and how aging signs appear around the eyes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-2\">Areas of Concern Addressed by a Liquid Eyelid Lift</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>A non-surgical eyelid lift can effectively address several specific concerns:</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Sagging Upper Eyelids</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Lifts and firms drooping upper eyelids.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Under-Eye Hollows</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Fills in hollow areas for a smoother contour.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Crow's Feet</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Reduces fine lines and wrinkles around the eyes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Dark Circles</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Lightens dark circles to brighten the eye area.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_39057c9785a162ed3dc85522dafbcd32-column-4\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Puffiness</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Minimizes puffiness and eye bags for a more rested appearance.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-3\">Results and Benefits of a Non-Surgical Eyelid Lift</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>A non-surgical eyelid lift offers many benefits, making it a popular choice for those seeking to rejuvenate their appearance without surgery.</span></p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Immediate and Long-Lasting Results</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_1b22626784c08b732911c121b8b0c9fc\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_1b22626784c08b732911c121b8b0c9fc-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Instant Improvement</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>See noticeable enhancement in the appearance of the eyelids immediately after the procedure.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_1b22626784c08b732911c121b8b0c9fc-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Sustained Effects</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Depending on option, results can last from several months to over a year.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h3>Natural Enhancement</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_c636da1a98d22265cfcb5a71f109294f\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_c636da1a98d22265cfcb5a71f109294f-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Subtle Changes</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Achieve a natural, refreshed look that complements your overall appearance.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_c636da1a98d22265cfcb5a71f109294f-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Tailored Approach</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>The treatment can be customized to your specific needs and aesthetic goals.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h3>Boosted Confidence</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_fc8ccd859ba0dadf4bb5f3d9da0fb08f\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_fc8ccd859ba0dadf4bb5f3d9da0fb08f-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Youthful Appearance</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Restore a youthful, vibrant look, making you feel more confident and attractive.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_fc8ccd859ba0dadf4bb5f3d9da0fb08f-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Minimal Downtime</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Enjoy the benefits of a refreshed appearance with minimal disruption to your daily life.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"section-4\">Schedule Your Non-Surgical Eyelid Lift Consultation at AestheticEye</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>If you are interested in rejuvenating your eyes with a non-surgical eyelid lift, contact AestheticEye today to </span><a href=\"#/contact/\">schedule a consultation</a><span>. Our expert surgeons, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, are dedicated to providing the highest level of care and advanced non-surgical treatments. Discover how our personalized approach can help you achieve a youthful and vibrant appearance at AestheticEye.</span></p>\n"}